{{also|Anschreiben}}
==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʔanʃʀaɪ̯bm̩/|/ˈʔanʃʀaɪ̯bən/}}
* {{audio|de|De-anschreiben.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=1|schreibt an|schrieb an|angeschrieben|past subjunctive=schriebe an}}

# to [[address]] somebody in writing, especially per mail
#: {{ux|de|Sie musste ihn mehrmals '''anschreiben''', weil sie keine Antwort erhielt.|She had to write to him several times, because she did not receive an answer.}}
# to put on the [[slate]]
#: {{ux|de|Er läßt schon wieder beim Laden '''anschreiben'''.|He let it be '''put on his slate''' in the store again.}}

